<title>SWITZERLAND: Sustainable Performance Group stock set at Sfr 417.</title>
<headline>Sustainable Performance Group stock set at Sfr 417.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sustainable Performance Group (SPG) said it would offer a maximum 499,500 shares to the public through July 11. The 200 Swiss franc par shares have been priced at 417 francs per share, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Trading on the Swiss Exchange is to start on August 8.</p>
<p>SPG is an equity investment company formed by Swiss Re, the Volkart Group and Sustainable Asset Management.</p>
<p>It will invest in companies that display an above-average yield/risk profile on the basis of their competitive position, management quality, financial strength and long-term business strategy, it said. -- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
